// =============================================================================
//  TM INDICATOR 2 & STRATEGY LAB 2  -  v2.1.0
//  Next-Gen Multi-Asset Quantitative Trading & Analysis System
//  Architecture: Modular Build (tools/build.mjs) -> pine/dist/
//
//  Key Architectural Pillars (Roadmap v2):
//    1. Dynamic Trade Management: Auto Break-Even @ TP1, Trailing Stop @ TP2,
//       Time-Decay / Stagnation Exit.
//    2. Smart Entry Execution: Market on Confirm vs Pullback Limit Entry
//       (50% FVG / Order Block Edge / EMA Fast) with auto-cancellation after K bars.
//    3. Market Regime Classifier: Real-time detection of TRENDING, RANGING,
//       and CHOPPY / SQUEEZE with dynamic regime-adaptive scoring weights.
//    4. Room-to-Left / HTF Obstacle Gate: Checks distance to opposing structural
//       barriers (S/R, OB) before entry; blocks trades if Obstacle < TP1.
//    5. Anti-Overextension Gate: Detects price exhaustion (Extension > Max ATR
//       or Candle Spread > 2.5x ATR) and forces pullback limit entry.
//    6. Inter-Market & Session Intelligence: BTC Leader Filter for ETH/Altcoins,
//       Crypto Weekend Low-Liquidity Filter, and MTF Hierarchy validation.
//    7. Pine v6 Tuple MTF & Memory Optimization: Zero-repaint tuple requests,
//       strictly capped under 5 request.security() calls, with drawing GC.
//
//  v2.1 additions (validation-first, no performance claim without OOS data):
//    8. Direction-aware scoring: independent LONG/SHORT 0..100 side scores from
//       the same weights, a minimum side score and a direction margin. The old
//       signed quality score blocked SHORT by construction and is gone.
//    9. Entry modes by market state: A Trend Pullback, B Liquidity Sweep
//       Reversal, C Range Mean-Reversion (opt-in), each with activation,
//       confirmation, invalidation and expiry.
//   10. Reason-code telemetry: every blocker emits a standardized code, the
//       dashboard shows the top reason plus the full blocker mask, and alerts
//       carry the scores/side/status/mode that produced the signal.
//   11. Dashboard Compact (default) / Advanced modes + lifecycle funnel
//       (candidate -> eligible -> pending -> filled -> closed).
//
//  Verification Standard:
//    - TP1 Hit Rate (%) and Net Trade Winrate (%) separated on the dashboard.
//    - WINRATE IS NOT A CLAIM: any improvement needs the ablation/walk-forward
//      protocol and an out-of-sample report (docs/indicator/tm-indicator-2/).
// =============================================================================
